ent-XenoborgMiner = miner xenoborg
    .desc = The mothership's one and only miner xenoborg. Equipped to gather rare materials. Its chassis looks far too elegant to mass-produce...
    .suffix = with brain

ent-XenoborgModuleMiner = miner xenoborg module
    .desc = Standard mining equipment for a miner xenoborg. What else did you expect?

ent-XenoborgModuleAdvancedMiner = advanced miner xenoborg module
    .desc = Improved xenoborg mining equipment with a diamond pickaxe, rapid-fire stunner, expanded ore bag and mineral scanner. Now this is for the big robots!

ent-XenoborgMinerPickaxe = miner xenoborg pickaxe
    .desc = A flimsy standard pickaxe locked into a xenoborg socket. It feels like one swing could flip the whole xenoborg over...

ent-XenoborgMinerDiamondPickaxe = miner xenoborg diamond pickaxe
    .desc = One hell of a pickaxe! Dwarves could only dream of one like this!

ent-WeaponDisablerXenoborgMiner = miner xenoborg stunner
    .desc = A self-recharging stunner for the miner xenoborg.

ent-WeaponDisablerSMGXenoborgMiner = miner xenoborg SMG stunner
    .desc = A self-recharging rapid-fire stunner for the miner xenoborg.

ent-WeaponXenoborgPortalGun = xenoborg redspace gun
    .desc = Teleports a living target somewhere random... Wonder if Rick has already stolen it from the Syndicate?...

ent-XenoborgPortalBolt = xenoborg portal charge

ent-XenoborgJaunter = xenoborg jaunter
    .desc = A reusable jaunter that returns its user to the mothership core.

ent-XenoborgJaunterAdvanced = advanced xenoborg jaunter
    .desc = An improved reusable jaunter that returns its user to the mothership core.

ent-XenoborgEnergySwordBlue = blue xenoborg energy sword
    .desc = A full-sized xenoborg energy sword.

ent-RedHeavyLaserXenoborg = xenoborg heavy laser bolt

xenoborg-type-miner = [color= #d6b328]miner xenoborgs[/color]

xenoborg-jaunter-no-destination = There is no safe destination near the mothership core.
xenoborg-jaunter-activate = The jaunter returns you to the mothership!
